      "unit": "u26",
      "source": "4 Shipboard Installation and Tests\n4-8-4\niii)\nContainer carriers or dry cargo vessels carrying dangerous goods or vehicles with fuel in\ntheir tanks. See 5C-5-7/3.\niv)\nRoll-on/roll-off vessels carrying vehicles with fuel in their tanks. See 5C-10-4/3 and\n5C-10-4/5.\nv)\nLiquefied gas carriers carrying flammable gases. See 5C-8-1/2.24.\nvi)\nChemical carriers carrying flammable liquid having a flash point of 60°C or below. See\n5C-9-10/1.4.\nvii)\nDrilling vessels performing exploratory or production drilling of hydrocarbon deposits.\nSee 4-3-6/3 of the ABS Mobile Offshore Unit Rules.\nviii)\nFloating hydrocarbon production facilities. See the ABS Rules for Building and Classing\nFloating Production Installations.",
